            "voiceBlipDurationMs": 48,
            "voiceBlipVolume": 55,
            "voiceBlipMinIntervalMs": 42
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "六月，高二下学期。期末考前最后一场班会，教室里弥漫着粉笔灰和风油精的味道。",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "2dfa5bfd-4b44-48c8-a696-8a0ac9c24fc6",
          "type": "narration",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": "",
            "voiceBlip": false,
            "voiceBlipPreset": "",
            "voiceBlipWaveform": "triangle",
            "voiceBlipBaseFrequencyHz": 340,
            "voiceBlipPitchRangeSemitones": 2.4,
            "voiceBlipDurationMs": 48,
            "voiceBlipVolume": 55,
            "voiceBlipMinIntervalMs": 42
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "班长念到第三页的时候，那种「跟我没关系」的低低的骚动，停了一拍。",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "fa2fbaa9-d5fc-440b-990d-9bd73fcf92fd",
          "type": "narration",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": "",
            "voiceBlip": false,
            "voiceBlipPreset": "",
            "voiceBlipWaveform": "triangle",
            "voiceBlipBaseFrequencyHz": 340,
            "voiceBlipPitchRangeSemitones": 2.4,
            "voiceBlipDurationMs": 48,
            "voiceBlipVolume": 55,
            "voiceBlipMinIntervalMs": 42
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "「——天文部，三十天后正式废除。天文台钥匙，由负责人限期交还学生会。」",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "82e075e6-407d-4ed0-a3cb-56deaac41c2a",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "characterId": "char-ritu",
            "characterName": "柏木律",
            "expression": "平静",
            "position": "center",
            "isFirst": false,
            "isLast": false,
            "showCharacter": false,
            "keepCharacter": true,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": "e4fbba57c192831252e165b47322dd3d"
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "「天文台使用记录连续三年为零，属应废部项。有异议，三十天内提交成果。」",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "295b67b0-2add-4f44-afdb-35c280883e1b",
          "type": "narration",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": "",
            "voiceBlip": false,
            "voiceBlipPreset": "",
            "voiceBlipWaveform": "triangle",
            "voiceBlipBaseFrequencyHz": 340,
            "voiceBlipPitchRangeSemitones": 2.4,
            "voiceBlipDurationMs": 48,
            "voiceBlipVolume": 55,
            "voiceBlipMinIntervalMs": 42
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "全班哄笑了一声。天文部。连我一个，总共一个部员的天文部。",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "82f6ef18-cf09-43c9-9bb1-c5523fcc031d",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "characterId": "char-me",
            "characterName": "我",
            "expression": "",
            "position": "",
            "isFirst": false,
            "isLast": false,
            "showCharacter": false,
            "keepCharacter": true,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": "e4fbba57c192831252e165b47322dd3d"
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "「……三十天。」",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "9b72e317-e182-43d9-bc23-dda1bce45cd1",
          "type": "narration",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": "",
            "voiceBlip": false,
            "voiceBlipPreset": "",
            "voiceBlipWaveform": "triangle",
            "voiceBlipBaseFrequencyHz": 340,
            "voiceBlipPitchRangeSemitones": 2.4,
            "voiceBlipDurationMs": 48,
            "voiceBlipVolume": 55,
            "voiceBlipMinIntervalMs": 42
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "我把通知单折了两折塞进口袋，折口对着折口，像给什么东西提前收殓。",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "807b1bcf-1fff-4048-acba-2c157b7346aa",
          "type": "scene",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "sceneId": "scene-cafe",
            "sceneName": "部室",
            "uri": "",
            "autoAddToGallery": "true",
