        {
          "id": "66734a28-817e-4176-99f2-4f1be4a12021",
          "type": "narration",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": "",
            "voiceBlip": false,
            "voiceBlipPreset": "",
            "voiceBlipWaveform": "triangle",
            "voiceBlipBaseFrequencyHz": 340,
            "voiceBlipPitchRangeSemitones": 2.4,
            "voiceBlipDurationMs": 48,
            "voiceBlipVolume": 55,
            "voiceBlipMinIntervalMs": 42
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "天文部的部室，是天文台楼下的小间。墙上钉着一张 1994 年的合影——最后一批部员，一共五个人。",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "03a8bfd8-77b6-445a-875a-2ae611936097",
          "type": "narration",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": "",
            "voiceBlip": false,
            "voiceBlipPreset": "",
            "voiceBlipWaveform": "triangle",
            "voiceBlipBaseFrequencyHz": 340,
            "voiceBlipPitchRangeSemitones": 2.4,
            "voiceBlipDurationMs": 48,
            "voiceBlipVolume": 55,
            "voiceBlipMinIntervalMs": 42
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "角落里站着一个白头发的女孩。照片褪了色，可那头白发，褪得干干净净。",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "464194d5-9fa5-4574-9046-37e568b3324c",
          "type": "narration",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": "",
            "voiceBlip": false,
            "voiceBlipPreset": "",
            "voiceBlipWaveform": "triangle",
            "voiceBlipBaseFrequencyHz": 340,
            "voiceBlipPitchRangeSemitones": 2.4,
            "voiceBlipDurationMs": 48,
            "voiceBlipVolume": 55,
            "voiceBlipMinIntervalMs": 42
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "部员名单一共五行，第四行被水渍晕开，只剩「星野——」两个字的一半。",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "1533f1b4-0d70-47da-be0d-92dbc84195ff",
          "type": "narration",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": "",
            "voiceBlip": false,
            "voiceBlipPreset": "",
            "voiceBlipWaveform": "triangle",
            "voiceBlipBaseFrequencyHz": 340,
            "voiceBlipPitchRangeSemitones": 2.4,
            "voiceBlipDurationMs": 48,
            "voiceBlipVolume": 55,
            "voiceBlipMinIntervalMs": 42
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "……巧了。和昨晚在天台上自称「部员二号」的那家伙，一个姓。",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "4329be7f-918a-463c-af3d-ac7efa3eaa30",
          "type": "scene",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "sceneId": "scene-rooftop",
            "sceneName": "天台",
            "uri": "",
            "autoAddToGallery": "true",
            "galleryMethodTarget": "avg.internal.default-shell/add-to-gallery",
            "transitionMode": "fade",
            "transitionDuration": "1000",
            "transitionDirection": "",
            "transitionStrips": "12",
            "transitionRuleUri": "",
            "transitionCenterX": "50",
            "transitionCenterY": "50",
