          }
        },
        {
          "id": "edbac19b-3991-4679-be7c-98ac99b18d31",
          "type": "narration",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": "",
            "voiceBlip": false,
            "voiceBlipPreset": "",
            "voiceBlipWaveform": "triangle",
            "voiceBlipBaseFrequencyHz": 340,
            "voiceBlipPitchRangeSemitones": 2.4,
            "voiceBlipDurationMs": 48,
            "voiceBlipVolume": 55,
            "voiceBlipMinIntervalMs": 42
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "放学后我没回家，抱着用了三年的钥匙上顶楼。然后发现——本该锁着的天台门，开着。",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "f26566a5-ece2-44de-89e6-898c82a18c85",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "characterId": "char-hoshino",
            "characterName": "星野",
            "expression": "害羞",
            "position": "right",
            "isFirst": true,
            "isLast": false,
            "showCharacter": true,
            "keepCharacter": true,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": "e4fbba57c192831252e165b47322dd3d"
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "「……啊。被发现了。」",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "7c968200-c2b3-4706-91b4-175360d83af0",
          "type": "narration",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": "",
            "voiceBlip": false,
            "voiceBlipPreset": "",
            "voiceBlipWaveform": "triangle",
            "voiceBlipBaseFrequencyHz": 340,
            "voiceBlipPitchRangeSemitones": 2.4,
            "voiceBlipDurationMs": 48,
            "voiceBlipVolume": 55,
            "voiceBlipMinIntervalMs": 42
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "水塔的阴影里坐着个女生。白头发被风吹得乱七八糟，像一团没拧好的月光。",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "35291d6f-19c4-43c7-a3aa-6c8cb2d3bafe",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "characterId": "char-me",
            "characterName": "我",
            "expression": "",
            "position": "",
            "isFirst": false,
            "isLast": false,
            "showCharacter": false,
            "keepCharacter": true,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": "e4fbba57c192831252e165b47322dd3d"
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "「这里平时不上人。你，怎么进来的？」",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "160d08dd-6b91-480b-8f76-40d9a7cffe75",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "characterId": "char-hoshino",
            "characterName": "星野",
            "expression": "开心",
            "position": "right",
            "isFirst": false,
            "isLast": false,
            "showCharacter": true,
            "keepCharacter": true,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": "e4fbba57c192831252e165b47322dd3d"
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "「嘿嘿，商业机密～」她拍拍身边的地面，「坐吧，管理员先生。猎户座马上就出来了。」",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "f04e04ca-1c7d-464b-84f8-4a211956da89",
          "type": "narration",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": "",
            "voiceBlip": false,
            "voiceBlipPreset": "",
            "voiceBlipWaveform": "triangle",
            "voiceBlipBaseFrequencyHz": 340,
            "voiceBlipPitchRangeSemitones": 2.4,
            "voiceBlipDurationMs": 48,
            "voiceBlipVolume": 55,
            "voiceBlipMinIntervalMs": 42
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "我鬼使神差地坐下了。水泥地还留着白天晒过的余温。",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "e74ce12b-f090-4899-b2c6-90fb71fd6265",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "characterId": "char-hoshino",
            "characterName": "星野",
            "expression": "平静",
            "position": "right",
            "isFirst": false,
            "isLast": false,
            "showCharacter": true,
            "keepCharacter": true,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": "e4fbba57c192831252e165b47322dd3d"
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "「你看，那三颗排成一条线的。到了冬天会斜着挂在天上，像一条滑梯。」",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "7cb7c480-cbd6-46fd-b892-f5ca24b368b6",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "characterId": "char-me",
            "characterName": "我",
            "expression": "",
            "position": "",
            "isFirst": false,
            "isLast": false,
            "showCharacter": false,
            "keepCharacter": true,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": "e4fbba57c192831252e165b47322dd3d"
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "「猎户座。你是天文部的？」",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "a3ae3280-0c7c-42da-aa18-97e4a3b85b7a",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "characterId": "char-hoshino",
            "characterName": "星野",
            "expression": "开心",
            "position": "right",
            "isFirst": false,
            "isLast": false,
            "showCharacter": true,
            "keepCharacter": true,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": "e4fbba57c192831252e165b47322dd3d"
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "「现在是了！部员二号，报到！」她敬了个完全不标准的礼，「顺便说，我是来找能装下约定的地方的。」",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "c5bbf06a-27bb-420d-b313-6210e65caecc",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "characterId": "char-me",
            "characterName": "我",
            "expression": "",
            "position": "",
            "isFirst": false,
            "isLast": false,
            "showCharacter": false,
            "keepCharacter": true,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": "e4fbba57c192831252e165b47322dd3d"
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "「约定？」",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "dd27e6ba-b886-4022-aec0-3bf6d43c2e37",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "characterId": "char-hoshino",
            "characterName": "星野",
            "expression": "平静",
            "position": "right",
            "isFirst": false,
            "isLast": false,
            "showCharacter": true,
            "keepCharacter": true,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": "e4fbba57c192831252e165b47322dd3d"
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "「嗯。我妈说过——说出口的约定，会变成星星的轨道。就算人走散了，它也会自己绕回来。」",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "2fe918b8-bf58-4243-905a-a79d6258bd9c",
          "type": "narration",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": "",
            "voiceBlip": false,
            "voiceBlipPreset": "",
            "voiceBlipWaveform": "triangle",
            "voiceBlipBaseFrequencyHz": 340,
            "voiceBlipPitchRangeSemitones": 2.4,
            "voiceBlipDurationMs": 48,
            "voiceBlipVolume": 55,
            "voiceBlipMinIntervalMs": 42
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "三十天后，是英仙座流星雨的极大夜。我说，那晚天文台最后一次开放，要不要一起，把最后一份观测记录写完。",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "4f881c40-cdd5-4519-8e23-4900f615a5c8",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "characterId": "char-hoshino",
            "characterName": "星野",
            "expression": "开心",
            "position": "right",
            "isFirst": false,
            "isLast": false,
            "showCharacter": true,
            "keepCharacter": true,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": "e4fbba57c192831252e165b47322dd3d"
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "「成交！这可是约定哦，管理员先生。」",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "82b8b3ac-eea1-419f-8a18-19cc34bbf5d9",
          "type": "narration",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": "",
            "voiceBlip": false,
            "voiceBlipPreset": "",
            "voiceBlipWaveform": "triangle",
            "voiceBlipBaseFrequencyHz": 340,
            "voiceBlipPitchRangeSemitones": 2.4,
            "voiceBlipDurationMs": 48,
            "voiceBlipVolume": 55,
            "voiceBlipMinIntervalMs": 42
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
